      "content": "It's clear you see the exhaustion in them, and that weight you feel is immense. If you're constantly in the role of the problem, then perhaps the problem is the pressure itself, not you. Reaching out to a professional, even if you feel like you've tried everything, might offer a different lens on this exhaustion. Sometimes, just talking to someone impartial can shift the dynamic, even slightly.",
      "source": "target",
